sofa with a laptop on his knee. The Evri website is visible on the screen. He looks deep in thought.","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10946.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C3553%2C8192%2C1911&w=1200&h=280","Z6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt",{"x":51,"y":218,"zoom":52,"background":70},3553,{"dimensions":220,"alt":214,"copyright":29,"url":223,"id":216,"edit":224},{"width":221,"height":222},704,240,"quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10946.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=428%2C3193%2C6660%2C2270&w=704&h=240",{"x":225,"y":226,"zoom":227,"background":70},428,3193,1.23,{"dimensions":229,"alt":214,"copyright":29,"url":232,"id":216,"edit":233},{"width":230,"height":231},343,160,"quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6o1bJbqstJ9-cYt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10946.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=733%2C2407%2C6554%2C3057&w=343&h=160",{"x":234,"y":235,"zoom":236,"background":70},733,2407,1.25,"photo_block$0e770558-d23c-41e7-ad49-b5523a6b4d5a","photo_block",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":240,"primary":265,"id":268,"slice_type":139,"slice_label":29},[241,247,252,260],{"title":242,"content":243,"isNumbered":244,"icon":245,"image":246},"Log into your Evri account",[],true,{},{},{"title":248,"content":249,"isNumbered":244,"icon":250,"image":251},"Select your saved address",[],{},{},{"title":253,"content":254,"isNumbered":244,"icon":258,"image":259},"Pick your parcel profile",[255],{"type":33,"text":256,"spans":257},"",[],{},{},{"title":261,"content":262,"isNumbered":244,"icon":263,"image":264},"Add to basket",[],{},{},{"theme":29,"title":266,"description":267,"showPaddingTop":20},"How to use Evri Quick Send","We’ve made sending parcels super quick and easy. Simply create an Evri account and follow the steps to save a new parcel profile or address. Each time you use Quick Send, all you need to do is:","list_block$d7d3fec7-33d7-4369-9bbc-7cc69f5d9172",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":270,"primary":271,"id":286,"slice_type":287,"slice_label":29},[],{"title":272,"bodyText":273,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":20,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":29,"buttonLink":277,"image":278},"Are you VAT registered?",[274],{"type":33,"text":275,"spans":276,"direction":77},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"link_type":42},{"dimensions":279,"alt":281,"copyright":29,"url":282,"id":283,"edit":284},{"width":64,"height":280},665,"Customer sat at a desk in their office taking a phone call and looking at a laptop.","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R5s5bqstJ9-STg_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8528.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R5s5bqstJ9-STg",{"x":51,"y":285,"zoom":52,"background":70},8,"feature_banner$5e249e0a-c9a4-4976-bc0d-be91fbf99b75","feature_banner",{"variation":289,"version":25,"items":290,"primary":352,"id":362,"slice_type":363,"slice_label":29},"3Column",[291,312,332],{"Title":292,"Description":297,"Image":301,"Label":29,"UrlText":307,"Url":308,"buttonDataGtmTrack":29,"SecondaryButtonText":29,"SecondaryButtonUrl":311,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":29,"ShowAppDownloadCta":29},[293],{"type":294,"text":295,"spans":296},"heading3","Our ParcelShops",[],[298],{"type":33,"text":299,"spans":300,"direction":77},"We have 9,000+ ParcelShops conveniently located around the UK for you to use. You can find us in corner shops, Post Office branches and more - simply use our ParcelShop finder tool to locate your nearest one.",[],{"dimensions":302,"alt":303,"copyright":29,"url":304,"id":305,"edit":306},{"width":64,"height":65},"Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance.","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":70},"ParcelShops",{"link_type":38,"key":309,"url":310},"07b9139c-3f12-4d3c-b4db-2a62763931c7","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":42},{"Title":313,"Description":317,"Image":321,"Label":29,"UrlText":327,"Url":328,"buttonDataGtmTrack":29,"SecondaryButtonText":29,"SecondaryButtonUrl":331,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":29,"ShowAppDownloadCta":29},[314],{"type":294,"text":315,"spans":316},"Our Lockers",[],[318],{"type":33,"text":319,"spans":320,"direction":77},"Like our ParcelShops, our Lockers provide a fast, secure, and convenient option for your parcel drop offs. Accessible 24\u002F7, you can post your parcel at a time that suit you. Simply book online, pop your parcel in one of the available Lockers in your area, and we'll collect it for delivery.",[],{"dimensions":322,"alt":323,"copyright":29,"url":324,"id":325,"edit":326},{"width":64,"height":65},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":70},"Lockers",{"link_type":38,"key":329,"url":330},"0407ab6d-cc0f-47a4-93e2-42d711273215","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":42},{"Title":333,"Description":337,"Image":341,"Label":29,"UrlText":347,"Url":348,"buttonDataGtmTrack":29,"SecondaryButtonText":29,"SecondaryButtonUrl":351,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":29,"ShowAppDownloadCta":29},[334],{"type":294,"text":335,"spans":336},"Our Courier collection",[],[338],{"type":33,"text":339,"spans":340},"If you're unable to drop off your parcel, our Courier collection service can pick it up straight from your door at home or the office. We'll even send you a 1-hour collection window so you'll know when to expect us.",[],{"dimensions":342,"alt":343,"copyright":29,"url":344,"id":345,"edit":346},{"width":64,"height":65},"A courier is handing a blue collection receipt to an older woman at her door.","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10254.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":70},"Courier collection",{"link_type":38,"key":349,"url":350},"081ac021-476d-405e-943c-6feb2c08cee6","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":42},{"SectionTitle":353,"SectionDescription":358,"theme":29},[354],{"type":355,"text":356,"spans":357},"heading2","Our 3 easy ways to send a parcel",[],[359],{"type":33,"text":360,"spans":361},"When you book your parcel online using Quick Send, you can choose from our three easy ways to send. Learn more about how to use our ParcelShops, Lockers, and Courier collection service below:",[],"article_link_module$05eb0fa3-a5b0-45a3-87aa-e26dfd890a88","article_link_module",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":365,"primary":406,"id":415,"slice_type":363,"slice_label":29},[366,386],{"Title":367,"Description":370,"Image":374,"Label":29,"UrlText":381,"Url":382,"buttonDataGtmTrack":29,"SecondaryButtonText":29,"SecondaryButtonUrl":385,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":29,"ShowAppDownloadCta":29},[368],{"type":294,"text":47,"spans":369},[],[371],{"type":33,"text":372,"spans":373},"Don’t need to send multiple parcels? No problem. You can book your parcel online with us and choose from our range of services to suit your needs.",[],{"dimensions":375,"alt":376,"copyright":29,"url":377,"id":378,"edit":379},{"width":64,"height":65},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling at the customer and handing a blue receipt to confirm that their parcel has been accepted.","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJGJbqstJ9-Tfq_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2730.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJGJbqstJ9-Tfq",{"x":380,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":70},47,"Send a parcel",{"link_type":38,"key":383,"url":384},"47b4fa57-8c49-4370-a013-23152d0a7253","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",{"link_type":42},{"Title":387,"Description":391,"Image":395,"Label":29,"UrlText":401,"Url":402,"buttonDataGtmTrack":29,"SecondaryButtonText":29,"SecondaryButtonUrl":405,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":29,"ShowAppDownloadCta":29},[388],{"type":294,"text":389,"spans":390},"Bulk send",[],[392],{"type":33,"text":393,"spans":394},"Link your marketplace or ecommerce platforms and send multiple parcels even easier with our Bulk Integrations tool.",[],{"dimensions":396,"alt":397,"copyright":29,"url":398,"id":399,"edit":400},{"width":64,"height":65},"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":70},"View integrations",{"link_type":38,"key":403,"url":404},"48c5b887-c1e0-44ef-8dac-c205a6525f61","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fbulk-send",{"link_type":42},{"SectionTitle":407,"SectionDescription":411,"theme":29},[408],{"type":355,"text":409,"spans":410},"More ways to book your parcel",[],[412],{"type":33,"text":413,"spans":414},"New to using Evri’s services? Check out our sending options for you to choose from:",[],"article_link_module$4e8152bd-7498-4363-ac8e-617e6c8fadfe",{"variation":417,"version":25,"items":418,"primary":420,"id":438,"slice_type":439,"slice_label":29},"darkBannerLeftImageButton",[419],{},{"theme":29,"show_premium_logo":29,"label":29,"label_theme":29,"titleH2":421,"bodyText":422,"image":426,"buttonText":433,"buttonDataGtmTrack":29,"buttonLink":434,"primary_button_external":29,"button_secondary":437,"secondary_button_external":29},"Send packages overseas",[423],{"type":33,"text":424,"spans":425},"Did you know we deliver to over 200+ countries and territories? Find out more about sending packages internationally to see how much you could save on sending your parcel abroad.",[],{"dimensions":427,"alt":428,"copyright":29,"url":429,"id":430,"edit":431},{"width":64,"height":65},"A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above.","quick-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C6016%2C4013&w=1000&h=667","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":51,"y":432,"zoom":52,"background":70},2,"Send international parcel",{"link_type":38,"key":435,"url":436},"5acc61c0-1262-4e88-9731-32db2239f637","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services",{"link_type":42},"landing_feature_banner$ea257067-ce14-4cdf-897a-2739c5026b02","landing_feature_banner",[23,58,84,140,206,239,269,288,364,416],["Reactive",442],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":443,"$sclients":508,"$sglobal-basket-count":29},{"abtasty":444,"accessibe":447,"appPromoBanner":450,"autoDivertUpdates":453,"awin":456,"bulkInternational":459,"bulkSendEnabled":462,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":465,"enableBasketCount":468,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":471,"euCustomsDuty":474,"groovyAdvert":477,"newInternationalSendFlow":480,"newinternationalpages":486,"oohPreferenceFlag":490,"opentel":493,"premium":496,"savedCards":499,"smallParcelSize":502,"yourPricesDrawer":505},{"_createdAt":445,"_updatedAt":446,"enabled":244},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":448,"_updatedAt":449,"enabled":244},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":451,"_updatedAt":452,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":454,"_updatedAt":455,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26: